# Optional server-only AI authoring configuration. The app does not load this file.
# Copy one provider block into the server process environment, set its key, and
# choose a positive KEIR_AI_MAX_USD cap you explicitly authorize.

# OpenAI
# KEIR_AI_PROVIDER=openai
# KEIR_AI_MODEL=gpt-5.6-terra
